338
00:29:13,723 --> 00:29:19,479
Bangui 's Hyenas . Half Senegalese , half Central Africa .

339
00:29:19,521 --> 00:29:22,315
Chaka , Rafa , Papa Minuit .

340
00:29:22,357 --> 00:29:27,070
Same who disarmed the Seleka in Central Africa without firing a bullet .

341
00:29:27,111 --> 00:29:29,948
