Our friend helps to spot them before they get away .

360
00:31:46,000 --> 00:31:49,337
The Saloum is home to one of the largest varieties of fish in the world .

361
00:31:49,379 --> 00:31:52,507
Species ranging from 7 to 70 kg , depending on the location .

362
00:32:07,230 --> 00:32:09,023
BB guns ?

363
00:32:18,867 --> 00:32:20,743
