418
00:36:20,733 --> 00:36:21,818
Little bitch .

419
00:36:23,778 --> 00:36:27,031
Come , taco face . We need to talk .

420
00:36:27,073 --> 00:36:30,285
No , he stays here , I have to talk with him .

421
