450
00:39:21,039 --> 00:39:23,124
You know how that is . You 're half-Serrere .

451
00:39:23,166 --> 00:39:24,083
Only the good half .

452
00:39:26,461 --> 00:39:28,379
Well , I know that for many of us ,

453
